{
  "bookId": "hero-211205",
  "id": "bond-43803",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43803001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "碧竹葱葱，流水潺潺，一座古色古香的建筑矗立在少女眼前。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "是……书里提到过的「道场」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43803004",
              "text": "嗯，送给你的。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43803004",
              "text": "这样每天就可以在里面修行了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43803003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "非常感谢，这片竹林……就好像回到了我长大的小岛一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "那时候，爷爷……和大家都在。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803006",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "少女的语气染上了一丝感伤，但随即，她露出明朗的笑容。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "我没让大家失望，我在外面的世界遇到了许多有趣的事，见到了很多不错的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "也找到了……想要托付终身的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "尽管脸颊泛上了红霞，少女仍然目光坚定地看向你。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "|101|，请跟我来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803011",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "汐音带你来到后宅的某处，那里有一件精心包装的物品——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "这是我在这个世界亲手制作的金铃，尺寸大了一些，但和我腰上的是成对的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "请收下我的回礼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43803015",
              "text": "真漂亮。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43803015",
              "text": "我会好好珍藏它的。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43803014",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "伴侣。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43803017",
              "text": "什么？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43803016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "不习惯听我这样叫你吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "既然已经交换了定情信物，我们便结成了伴侣，不是么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43803019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "少女的嗓音和她的情意一般纯净无瑕，让你无法拒绝。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
